{"id":"659441","name":"碱水粽","author":"食·色","authorId":"34360","desc":"","cover":"images/659441/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米","amount":"600克"},{"name":"食用碱","amount":"6克"},{"name":"食用油","amount":"12克"}],"sub":[{"name":"粽叶","amount":"19张"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"用料：糯米600克，食用碱6克，油12克，粽叶19张。","img":"images/659441/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"提前浸泡糯米。","img":"images/659441/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"沥干水。","img":"images/659441/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入6克食用碱粉。","img":"images/659441/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"糯米遇碱立马就成了淡黄色，","img":"images/659441/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入食用油，","img":"images/659441/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"混拌均匀。放置半小时以上，让糯米充分吸收碱粉。","img":"images/659441/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"取一张粽叶，卷一圈半，成尖锥形，方向随意。","img":"images/659441/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"装入拌和好的糯米，填实压紧。","img":"images/659441/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"将上面的叶子盖住馅料。","img":"images/659441/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"再向一侧折叠，成三角锥形。","img":"images/659441/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"用粗棉线从顶至腰捆上一道。","img":"images/659441/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"全部包好。","img":"images/659441/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"剪去叶柄。","img":"images/659441/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放入锅中，水漫过粽子，大火上气后转小火煮3个小时。","img":"images/659441/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"粽子熟透，熄火。","img":"images/659441/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"出锅。去掉粽叶蘸白糖或蜂蜜食用。","img":"images/659441/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"煮制时间需根据粽子大小多少酌情调整。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}